Subject: [PATCH] downloads: preserve HLS streams and control individual tasks

Download-owned streaming keep-alive and persistent per-item pause/resume/restart with network-only speed. Shared audio/speed helpers are byte-identical to Mihon 0103. Local HLS demux retains PES/AAC state across TS files; expired addresses refresh once without deleting valid segments.
